        "z": "14e87492dacaa86f",
        "name": "dht11",
        "func": "var temp11 = msg.payload.suhu;\nvar hum11 = msg.payload.kelembapan;\nglobal.set(\"temp11\", msg.payload.suhu);\nglobal.set(\"hum11\", msg.payload.kelembapan);\n\nfunction formatDesimal(angka){\n    return Number(angka.toFixed(2));\n}\n\nvar tempKalibrasi = formatDesimal((0.8330450999 * temp11) + 6.167253154);\nvar humKalibrasi = formatDesimal((0.7699689581 * hum11) + 3.511367551);\n\nmsg.topic = \"espCoba/DHTk/payload\";\nmsg.payload = {tempKalibrasi, humKalibrasi};\n\nglobal.set(\"tempKalibrasi\", msg.payload.tempKalibrasi);\nglobal.set(\"humKalibrasi\", msg.payload.humKalibrasi);\n\nreturn msg;",
